#: ../../source/glob_README.md:102
msgid "glob.hasMagic(pattern, [options])"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/glob_README.md:104
msgid ""
"Returns `true` if there are any special characters in the pattern, and "
"`false` otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/glob_README.md:107
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Note that the options affect the results.  If `noext:true` is set in the "
"options object, then `+(a|b)` will not be considered a magic pattern.  If"
" the pattern has a brace expansion, like `a/{b/c,x/y}` then that is "
"considered magical, unless `nobrace:true` is set in the options."
msgstr ""

